# Stood by the CD block's lift (boot_at hub, facing west), turned to the pyramid (east), then
# looking up and back, every frame recorded. Two of the user's reports, 2026-11-15:
#  - "the pyramid does not show most of the time": the draw budget left out the arena, which on foot
#    in the city is the pyramid (game/draw_budget.h). Every shot pm_0x must show the pyramid
#  - "the circuit floor clips up, the fog doesn't hide it fast enough when starting to look up": the
#    fog's rows were rebuilt 2 frames after the camera moved, a frame out when a frame ran late
#    (game/floor_fade.h, floor_fade_tables). The flash check covers the look up. Held up 1.5 s, so
#    the sky seen only looking up is in still frames too (or it reads as stray colours)
record
boot_at hub
wait_up
wait 1.0
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 0.8
shot pm_00_east
wait 0.5
shot pm_01
wait 0.5
shot pm_02
wait 0.5
shot pm_03
flashes_from
keydown y
wait 0.15
shot pm_04_starting_up
wait 0.15
shot pm_05_up
wait 1.5
keyup y
wait 0.6
flashes_to hub_look_up
shot pm_06_back
